5650::$$$message_0038_0014_0000$$$::　[movefg opacity=255 time=500 top=145 left=480 accel=-2 storage=凛私服05c(遠) textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=-512 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=3 textoff=0][movefg opacity=255 left=575 top=0 time=500 accel=-2 layer=4 textoff=0]菓子箱？[lr]::
